{"speciesId":662,"names":{"fr":"Braisillon","es":"Fletchinder","en":"Fletchinder","ja":"ヒノヤコマ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il crache des étincelles pour brûler les hautes herbes et attraper les proies surprises qui tentent d’échapper à l’incendie."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Lanza chispas por su pico y prende fuego a la hierba alta para así sorprender a sus presas y atraparlas cuando intentan escapar."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"From its beak, it expels embers that set the tall grass on fire. Then it pounces on the bewildered prey that pop out of the grass."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"火の粉を クチバシから 飛ばして 草むらを 焦がし 驚いて 飛び出した 獲物を 捕まえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il possède une poche remplie de feu sur son ventre. Plus elle émet de chaleur, plus il vole vite. Cependant, elle met quelque temps à chauffer."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuanto más intenso sea el calor que se genera en la saca de fuego de su vientre, más rápido es capaz de volar. Sin embargo, la llama tarda en prender."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The hotter the flame sac on its belly, the faster it can fly, but it takes some time to get the fire going."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"お腹の 炎袋の 火力が 強まるほど 速く 飛べるが 点火するまで 時間が かかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il crache des étincelles pour brûler les hautes herbes et attraper les proies surprises qui tentent d’échapper à l’incendie."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lanza chispas por su pico y prende fuego a la hierba alta para así sorprender a sus presas y atraparlas cuando intentan escapar."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"From its beak, it expels embers that set the tall grass on fire. Then it pounces on the bewildered prey that pop out of the grass."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"火の粉を クチバシから 飛ばして 草むらを 焦がし 驚いて 飛び出した 獲物を 捕まえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il possède une poche remplie de feu sur son ventre. Plus elle émet de chaleur, plus il vole vite. Cependant, elle met quelque temps à chauffer."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuanto más intenso sea el calor que se genera en la saca de fuego de su vientre, más rápido es capaz de volar. Sin embargo, la llama tarda en prender."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The hotter the flame sac on its belly, the faster it can fly, but it takes some time to get the fire going."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"お腹の 炎袋の 火力が 強まるほど 速く 飛べるが 点火するまで 時間が かかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il crache des escarbilles par le bec, en visant sa proie. Une fois celle-ci capturée, il la fait rôtir avant de la déguster."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Lanza chispas por el pico para atacar a su presa, a la que devora una vez calcinada."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"From its beak, it fires embers at its prey. Once it has caught them, it grills them at high heat before feasting upon them."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"クチバシから 火の粉を 飛ばして 獲物に ぶつける。 捕まえた 獲物は 焼いてから いただくぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Son territoire s’étend sur plusieurs kilomètres. L’intrusion d’autres Braisillon n’est en aucun cas tolérée."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"No tolera bajo ningún concepto que otro Fletchinder invada su territorio, cuyo radio abarca varios kilómetros."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It will not tolerate other Fletchinder entering its territory, which has a radius of several miles."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"半径 数キロの 縄張りを 持っており 他の ヒノヤコマが 入ってくることを 許さない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il enflamme des touffes d’herbe en crachant des escarbilles. Il n’a plus qu’à s’emparer des Pokémon Insecte qui s’enfuient pour les gober."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Prende fuego a los arbustos con las chispas que suelta y aprovecha para cazar los Pokémon Bicho que salen corriendo despavoridos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It scatters embers in the tall grass. Then bug Pokémon, frightened by the flames, come flying out, and Fletchinder gobbles them up."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"草むらに ひのこを まき散らす。 炎に 驚いて 飛び出してきた むしポケモンを ぱくりと いただく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"À peine décolle-t-il que sa vitesse lui permet déjà de rivaliser avec les Pokémon oiseaux les plus rapides."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La velocidad que alcanza nada más emprender el vuelo es de las más altas de entre todos los Pokémon pájaro."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its speed right after takeoff already puts it in the top speed class of all bird Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"飛びはじめた 直後の スピードは すべての とりポケモンの 中でも トップクラスの 速さ なのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il lance des étincelles dans le terrier de ses proies pour les effrayer. Dès qu’elles en émergent, il les attaque à coups de serres."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Lanza chispas al interior de la guarida de su presa y, cuando esta sale despavorida, la ataca por sorpresa con sus afiladas garras."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Fletchinder launches embers into the den of its prey. When the prey comes leaping out, Fletchinder’s sharp talons finish it off."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"巣穴の中に 火の粉を 飛ばし 驚いて 出てきた 獲物を 鋭い ツメで しとめるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"De nature belliqueuse, il dispose d’un fort instinct territorial. Quand il chasse, il se dispute régulièrement les proies avec ses congénères."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Defienden su territorio con suma agresividad. Se pelean entre sí por el control de las áreas de caza."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Fletchinder are exceedingly territorial and aggressive. These Pokémon fight among themselves over feeding grounds."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"縄張り意識が とても 強く 好戦的。 餌場を めぐり ヒノヤコマ同士で 争う。"}],"varieties":[{"id":662,"moves":[{"name":"razor-wind","learns":[[15,"level-up",27],[16,"level-up",27],[17,"level-up",27],[18,"level-up",27]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",64],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",64],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"ember","learns":[[15,"level-up",17],[16,"level-up",17],[17,"level-up",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",0],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"flamethrower","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"peck","learns":[[15,"level-up",10],[16,"level-up",10],[17,"level-up",10],[18,"level-up",10],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"fire-spin","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"agility","learns":[[15,"level-up",13],[16,"level-up",13],[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13],[20,"level-up",29],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",29],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"quick-attack","learns":[[15,"level-up",6],[16,"level-up",6],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",6],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",6],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-blast","learns":[[15,"mac